---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { site } from "../../config/site";
---
<BaseLayout title="About"><section class="site-shell mx-auto grid gap-12 pt-16 md:grid-cols-[1fr_280px] md:pt-24"><div><div class="eyebrow">05 / About</div><h1 class="display mt-5 max-w-4xl text-6xl leading-[.95] md:text-8xl">An edited layer between the work and the world.</h1></div><div class="self-end text-sm leading-7"><div class="eyebrow mb-3">{site.alias}</div><p class="m-0">{site.location}<br />{site.headline}</p><a class="focus-ring mt-5 inline-block underline" href={site.github}>GitHub ↗</a></div></section><section class="site-shell mx-auto mt-16 grid gap-8 border-t border-[var(--line)] pt-8 md:grid-cols-[1fr_2fr]"><div class="eyebrow">Public boundary</div><div class="max-w-3xl text-base leading-8"><p>This site is a curated public layer, not a mirror of the private vault. Every page is explicitly reviewed, hashed, scanned, and copied into this repository before deployment.</p><p class="muted">The source of truth for personal notes stays local. The public site only contains material that can stand on its own without exposing private paths, people, credentials, or unverified claims.</p></div></section></BaseLayout>
